======
 dbt7
======

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7** [option...] [command [args...]]

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7** is a script that helps execute all the tools provided by the Database
Test 7 (DBT-7) test kit, a fair-use implementation of the TPC Benchmark(TM) DS.

COMMANDS
========

The available commands are determined by what is installed by the kit.  Run
**dbt7** without any command line arguments to see available commands.

OPTIONS
=======

--verbose  Output versions of additional programs used by DBT-7 when used with
        -V or --version OPTION
-V, --version  Output version information, then exit.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

ENVIRONMENT
===========

**PATCHDIR** can be set to specify the series of patches to apply to TPC-DS
Tools when running **build-dsgen**, default */usr/share/dbt7/patches*.

**PGHOST**, when unset, is set to */tmp,/var/run/postgresql* so that
PostgreSQL connections default to local Unix domain sockets.

